commit 4873c48b29c6840e117b06862f4cab6bc8ba161f

C03: the deletion reader owns the known-folder enum during argument grounding (FILES1243 repair)

«borrá el archivo viejo.txt» and «Delete old_note_fable.txt.» ground to
fileName + folder all_known: the literal-argument normalizer rejected
«all_known» because no word of the request names it (FILES1241/002, /003,
/005 ended as «solicitud no clara»). The same exemption the known-folder search
already has. No tests (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


